{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ea3ebce1-723b-8cd4-8ed8-e845f5afb6d2",
  "created_at": "2026-03-05T09:44:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rocco Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:42:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:42:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. My name is Rocco Barone. I am calling because I have a problem with my neighbor, and I want to make a complaint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:42:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Barone. What kind of complaint? Noise, trash, something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:42:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is the fence. His fence, it is leaning, leaning over into my yard. Every week more. Now is almost on my tomato, my little garden, you know? And he don't do nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:42:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the neighbor's fence is leaning onto your property. And you want to file a complaint about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. I don't want to ask about permit, nothing like that. I just want to complain on him. I already talk to him two times, he say okay, okay, and nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:43:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. What's the address where the fence is leaning, yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:43:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is number 1 Spring Street. One, Spring Street. Fifth Ward, the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:43:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One Spring Street, got it. And the neighbor, do you know his name or which house it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:43:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The house next to me, on the left side when you look from the street. The name I don't know good. Mister something, I never see the mailbox."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:43:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, we can work from the address. I'll write it up, and the office will send the neighbor a notice about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:43:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A novice? What is a novice? He is not a novice, he have that fence for ten years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:43:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not novice, notice. N-O-T-I-C-E. A letter, a written notice, telling him there's a complaint and he needs to deal with the fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:44:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, notice, okay, okay. A letter. Good, good. Very good. Because me, I am tired already, you know? Every day I look and it is more crooked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:44:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Is this number the best one to reach you at, in case someone needs to follow up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, is my cell. 401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:44:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, 401-555-0182. Someone will look at it, and the letter will go out. I can't tell you the exact day, but it'll get started."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:44:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. And somebody come to see the fence, or only the letter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:44:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The letter goes first. If nothing changes after that, call us back and we'll see about the next step."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:44:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Rosa. Gracias. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T09:44:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Barone. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
